03:20.940 --> 03:22.140
What is a divergence?

03:22.140 --> 03:27.320
A divergence guys is when price and the momentum oscillator do the opposite.

03:27.560 --> 03:33.120
So for a great example, if we see that the price is getting higher, like it is right

03:33.120 --> 03:34.920
here, right?

03:35.460 --> 03:40.040
