03:40.040 --> 03:40.760
to get lower.

03:41.360 --> 03:43.020
This is called a bearish divergence.

03:43.560 --> 03:44.700
Why is this a bearish divergence?

03:44.940 --> 03:46.140
Because think about it.

03:46.160 --> 03:50.980
If money is leaving the asset, yet the price is getting higher, what does that tell us?

03:51.260 --> 03:51.940
Unsustainable move.

03:51.940 --> 03:54.280
And there needs to be a correction, right?

03:54.280 --> 03:56.080
There needs to be some kind of a correction.

03:56.400 --> 03:59.160
